IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RPTGEN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT RPT-OUT ASSIGN TO RPTOUT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD RPT-OUT.
       01 RPT-LINE PIC X(132).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY RPTREC.
       COPY SUMREC.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RC.
       MAIN.
           OPEN OUTPUT RPT-OUT
           MOVE 'DAILY ACCOUNT SUMMARY' TO RPT-TITLE
           WRITE RPT-LINE FROM RPT-DETAIL
           CLOSE RPT-OUT
           MOVE 0 TO LK-RC
           GOBACK.
